    "_viewmodel_fit_note": "story 052, round 3 (the user chose the old guns' size: scale = the old Quaternius gun's length / the new gun's length behind the tip, as in round 1). Rotation: the barrel runs along the tip's forward and the tip's up is the sights' up (measured from the FBX mesh), so viewmodel_model_rotation is the inverse of the tip's local rotation; the model sits at its mount's identity. t' = the tip's position from the prop's origin in the tip's frame (right, up, forward). Offset: the tip (the muzzle) is put where the old gun's barrel ended (the old mesh's front at the old muzzle_offset's height; the old muzzle_offset itself sat about 2 cm ahead of that front), so offset = old front - scale x t' and the barrel line, the length and the screen area match the old gun (viewmodel_position is unchanged). muzzle_offset = offset + scale x t' (the flash at the tip). The grip hand goes on the new grip G (its visible centre) by the pistol's old wrist-to-grip relation from Pistol_1's mesh: wrist = G + (half width + 0.9 cm, 2.05 cm, -5 cm). Gun-relative reload keys = their values before story 052 moved by their gun feature's move (old one from the Quaternius mesh or the old keys, new one from the prop's mesh at this scale and offset); pouch and substance keys unchanged. SMG: scale 0.333 / 0.2007 = 1.66; t' (-0.0097, 0.0522, 0.1987); old front (0, 0.075, 0.273), so offset (0.016, -0.012, -0.057) and muzzle_offset (0, 0.075, 0.273); the gun spans z -0.054 to 0.273, y -0.086 to 0.117 (old -0.060 to 0.273, y -0.090 to 0.115). Casing eject: the receiver's right side 10 cm behind the tip, above the magazine. Grip (at the rear): G (-0.001, -0.023, -0.012), half width 0.0186, so the wrist (0.027, -0.003, -0.062) (old (0.025, -0.02, -0.03): this SMG's grip is at its back end). Magazine prop (0.12, 0.055, 0.03), the magazine box at scale. Reload: well keys by the well bottom's move from (0, -0.09, 0.114) to (-0.0011, -0.0762, 0.1161); bolt-rack keys by the receiver's left rear move at its middle height from (-0.0191, 0.078, -0.06) to (-0.0288, 0.0783, -0.0542).",
